sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FIN as FinanceManager
    participant CTRL as DisbursementsController
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant XL as ClosedXML/CSV Generator
    participant STOR as StorageService (Supabase)
    participant BANK as Banking Portal (manual, external)
    participant WH as WebhookDispatcherService

    Note over FIN,DB: Precondition: PayrollRun.Status = APPROVED<br/>(else 409 DISBURSEMENT_NOT_APPROVED)

    FIN->>CTRL: POST /disbursements {payrollRunId}
    CTRL->>DB: SELECT all PayrollEntry WHERE payroll_run_id
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT DisbursementBatch (status=Pending)
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT BankTransferRecord (one per entry,<br/>status=Pending, amount=NetSalary snapshot)

    CTRL->>XL: build CSV (Sr#, Code, Name, Bank, IBAN, Amount)
    CTRL->>XL: build Excel (formatted, protected cells)
    XL-->>CTRL: file bytes
    CTRL->>STOR: upload bank file
    STOR-->>CTRL: BankFileUrl
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE DisbursementBatch.Status = Generated,<br/>BankFileUrl, TotalAmount, TotalRecords
    CTRL-->>FIN: 200 { batchId, downloadUrls }

    FIN->>CTRL: GET /disbursements/{id}/download/csv
    CTRL-->>FIN: CSV file
    FIN->>BANK: manually upload CSV to bank portal<br/>(no direct bank API in v1, §1.5)
    BANK-->>FIN: transfer reference numbers (out of band)

    FIN->>CTRL: POST /disbursements/{id}/confirm
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE DisbursementBatch.Status = Confirmed,<br/>ConfirmedAt, ConfirmedBy

    opt some transfers failed
        FIN->>CTRL: PATCH /disbursements/{id}/records/{rid}/fail<br/>{failureReason}
        CTRL->>DB: UPDATE BankTransferRecord.Status = Failed
        CTRL->>DB: UPDATE DisbursementBatch.Status = PartiallyFailed
    end

    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = DISBURSED
    CTRL->>WH: fire webhook "payroll.disbursed"
    CTRL-->>FIN: 200 OK
